msgstr "远程控制时暂停"

#: crates/toolbox-ui/ui/main.slint:99
msgctxt "ui.clipboard.auto_suspend_hint"
msgid "While a remote-control session is active, stop reading and writing the clipboard so the two synchronizers do not overwrite each other. The process list is in config.json."
msgstr "检测到远程控制会话时，暂停读写剪贴板，避免两套同步互相覆盖。进程名单在 config.json 中编辑。"

